# An ancient [[Latin]] name for a small river in northern [[Italy]] which flows into the [[Adriatic Sea]]. It marked the boundary between the Roman province of [[Gaul]] and the Roman heartland. Its crossing by {{w|Julius Caesar}} in 49 BC began a civil war.

